# Task Execution

**Hook:** `cursor.rules`, `spec.flow`

- Work on one micro task at a time (see active task in `docs/specs/*/tasks.md`).
- Identify exact target files before editing.
- Avoid opportunistic refactors unless required for the task.
- State assumptions when interfaces are ambiguous.
- Prefer minimal complete changes over broad cleanup.
